Package: SynTangleR
Type: Package
Title: Chromosome Layout Optimization for GENESPACE
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Joseph", "Hanly", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "43384926+Hanliconius@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Reduce midpoint crossings in existing GENESPACE riparian displays
    using whole chromosome flips while preserving chromosome order, internal
    coordinates and every supplied link. Export directed synteny tables for
    full chromosome ordering with the SynTangle Python optimizer.
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.11), syntangle Python package
